# Aurora needs three env vars at runtime. Set them in .env.local (which is
# gitignored) or in your Vercel project's Environment Variables tab:
#
#   DATABASE_URL       Postgres connection string (e.g. from Neon)
#   AUTH_SECRET        Generate with: openssl rand -base64 32
#   ANTHROPIC_API_KEY  Get one at https://console.anthropic.com/
#
# This file (.env) is committed and intentionally empty — secrets live in
# .env.local locally and in Vercel's env vars in production.
